.TH STARTSDE 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
startsde \- start a Selviana Desktop Environment session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B startsde

.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBstartsde\fR prepares the session environment (XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=SDE, D-Bus) and runs \fBsde-session\fR(1). Display managers call it through \fI/usr/share/xsessions/sde.desktop\fR; from a text console use \fBstartx /usr/bin/startsde\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
None.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop/issues
